# This is a pnpm workspace (see packageManager in package.json). An npm command
# run from the repo root leaves a stub package-lock.json behind, and a stray one
# invites `npm install` here — which would build a flat node_modules that
# disagrees with pnpm-lock.yaml. Anchored to the root on purpose: kept/ is a
# separate npm project outside the workspace and its lockfile is real.
/package-lock.json
